icks? Maybe we secretly still do. This game captures that exact feeling\u2014a combination of playful chaos and relaxing moments. Go on an adventure, collect the best sticks, and challenge your friends to epic duels. But it's not all about combat; Stick A round also offers plenty of room to unwind and enjoy simple, relaxing activities.", "summary": "Relive the joy of your childhood in Stick A Round! Find uniquely generated sticks that transform into weapons based on their real-world shapes. Battle friends in combat, play action packed or relaxing minigames, and explore a changing world where your imagination sets the rules.", "themes": [{"id": 38, "name": "Open world"}, {"id": 40, "name": "Party"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/stick-a-round", "videos": [{"id": 160131, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "r8AuewGzxeA", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=r8AuewGzxeA", "title": "Stick A Round Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/r8AuewGzxeA/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 187909, "name": "Announcement Trailer", "video_id": "gxE9gBCEoNM", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=gxE9gBCEoNM", "title": "Stick A Round Demo Trailer: Settle the childhood debate..", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/gxE9gBCEoNM/qhddefault.jpg"}]}